{"3859270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mycubium", "steam_appid": 3859270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.poster.avif?t=1785419809\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.webm?t=1785419809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.mp4?t=1785419809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In a surreal world of ruin and shadow,</i> <i>your only tools are mushrooms, movement, and your mind.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mycubium</i></strong> is a serene yet challenging first-person puzzle adventure about growth, connection, and the quiet resilience of life. You play as an unknown being tasked with navigating a broken, otherworldly landscape—one bridge, one spore, one glowing mushroom at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each color of mushroom grows a bridge in a specific direction. With careful placement and strategic use of the environment, you’ll reconnect the forgotten paths of a once-vibrant world. As you explore deeper, new mechanics evolve: rotating platforms, diagonal bridges, teleportation, and more. Every level holds a hand-crafted set of puzzles that teach through play—no hints, no hand-holding, just intuition and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/2d62d2ab0c6bb4da6eac39ed3a505db4.avif?t=1785419809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras_big/2d62d2ab0c6bb4da6eac39ed3a505db4.avif?t=1785419809 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Spatial Mushroom Puzzle Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place mushrooms on white cubes to grow vibrant directional bridges. Solve puzzles using jumping, stacking, sticking, and color-aligned logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍄 <strong>A meditative narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Told through atmosphere and environment—no dialogue, minimal exposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 <strong>Exploration &amp; Secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple pathways, hidden collectibles, and platforming challenges. Use switches to open doors or trigger lasers to unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕰️ <strong>A Journey Through Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one full day across four levels. Each stage represents a new hour in this world’s slow reawakening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Minimalist soundscape and ambient score</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming, immersive audio experience designed to support reflection and focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Handcrafted environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a ruined fragment of a lost world waiting to be reconnected through your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Nonlinear Solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many puzzles have more than one solution. Find your own approach using intuition, creativity, and physics-based exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow bridges. Explore the unknown. Choose carefully what to leave behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/6979be2ffaba750373eebadac70509b9.avif?t=1785419809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras_big/6979be2ffaba750373eebadac70509b9.avif?t=1785419809 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.poster.avif?t=1785419809\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.webm?t=1785419809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/300d15e2b8c63bf0ba5903102f359544.mp4?t=1785419809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In a surreal world of ruin and shadow,</i> <i>your only tools are mushrooms, movement, and your mind.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mycubium</i></strong> is a serene yet challenging first-person puzzle adventure about growth, connection, and the quiet resilience of life. You play as an unknown being tasked with navigating a broken, otherworldly landscape—one bridge, one spore, one glowing mushroom at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each color of mushroom grows a bridge in a specific direction. With careful placement and strategic use of the environment, you’ll reconnect the forgotten paths of a once-vibrant world. As you explore deeper, new mechanics evolve: rotating platforms, diagonal bridges, teleportation, and more. Every level holds a hand-crafted set of puzzles that teach through play—no hints, no hand-holding, just intuition and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/2d62d2ab0c6bb4da6eac39ed3a505db4.avif?t=1785419809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras_big/2d62d2ab0c6bb4da6eac39ed3a505db4.avif?t=1785419809 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Spatial Mushroom Puzzle Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place mushrooms on white cubes to grow vibrant directional bridges. Solve puzzles using jumping, stacking, sticking, and color-aligned logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍄 <strong>A meditative narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Told through atmosphere and environment—no dialogue, minimal exposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 <strong>Exploration &amp; Secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple pathways, hidden collectibles, and platforming challenges. Use switches to open doors or trigger lasers to unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕰️ <strong>A Journey Through Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one full day across four levels. Each stage represents a new hour in this world’s slow reawakening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Minimalist soundscape and ambient score</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming, immersive audio experience designed to support reflection and focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Handcrafted environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a ruined fragment of a lost world waiting to be reconnected through your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Nonlinear Solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many puzzles have more than one solution. Find your own approach using intuition, creativity, and physics-based exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow bridges. Explore the unknown. Choose carefully what to leave behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras/6979be2ffaba750373eebadac70509b9.avif?t=1785419809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/extras_big/6979be2ffaba750373eebadac70509b9.avif?t=1785419809 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Mycubium is a first-person 3D puzzle platformer where you grow bridges using mushrooms in a minimalist cubic world. Explore and solve spatial puzzles across shifting landscapes filled with secrets, platforming challenges, and evolving mechanics. Build your path as the day fades to night.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/dc9ab2bd1b1587c1ca0b0f67f2b64fc5028ea4a4/header.jpg?t=1785419809", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/acef62fe404737c4458e9c13f1971868f2421c94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785419809", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859270/acef62fe404737c4458e9c13f1971868f2421c94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785419809", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-9600K/ AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>